    "title": "Aamir Khan rewrote climax of son Junaid Khan's Ek Din, says Mansoor Khan; here's why | Bollywood",
    "text": "Mansoor Khan reveals Aamir Khan rewrote the climax of Ek Din\nWhen asked whether he had any difference of opinion with Aamir over Ek Din, Mansoor said, “Today, I’m not that clued in, as I don’t watch films. But I still have my sensibilities intact. I believe in dealing with certain scenes with restraint rather than going over the top. I have a fairly good sense of story. I told them: I have come to help you. What I feel strongly about, I will tell you.”",
